# Auto push develop (no ask)

After finishing work in this repo, **commit the relevant files and `git push origin develop`**. Do not ask "say commit" or "say push".

## Do

- Commit only the files from this task (code + matching docs).
- Push `origin develop` when the commit succeeds.
- Tell the user the commit hash after push.

## Do not

- Do not push `main` or merge develop → main.
- Do not touch production Supabase (`levwrmvqdntngeasrtnb`) unless the user explicitly asks for a production release.
- Do not commit `node_modules`, `.env*`, secrets, or unrelated dirty files (`docs/ENVIRONMENTS.md` CRLF noise).
- Do not `--no-verify`, force-push, or amend a pushed commit.

"Push" / "commit" / "save" / finishing a feature = **develop only**.
